\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Causal confidence halting reaches the accuracy--compute frontier with a two-stage threshold. Per-seed held-out exact match against the ratio of executed recurrent-cell calls to each seed's frozen best fixed depth. Evolutionary halting policies cluster near the threshold: the confidence-bound rule accepts the threshold on all three seeds and only two of the nine searched policies. Curves connect policies evaluated at the same search budget, so horizontal differences measure actual skipped refinement calls rather than predicted exit depths.}}{5}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pareto}{{1}{5}{Causal confidence halting reaches the accuracy--compute frontier with a two-stage threshold. Per-seed held-out exact match against the ratio of executed recurrent-cell calls to each seed's frozen best fixed depth. Evolutionary halting policies cluster near the threshold: the confidence-bound rule accepts the threshold on all three seeds and only two of the nine searched policies. Curves connect policies evaluated at the same search budget, so horizontal differences measure actual skipped refinement calls rather than predicted exit depths}{figure.caption.7}{}}
